Task & Model & D\%\textsubscript{int} & D\%\textsubscript{det} & $\Delta$D\% & D / I / N \\
\midrule
freeze & Qwen-7B & 55 & 25 & +30 & 6 / 0 / 14 \\
freeze & Llama-8B & 40 & 20 & +20 & 1 / 0 / 4 \\
\midrule
find-non-living & Qwen-7B & 0 & 0 & 0 & 16 / 4 / 20 \\
